{{Politics of Balisca}}

'''Bastan!''' ({{literal translation|Enough!}}, officially stylized as '''BASTAN!''') is a [[W:Platformism|platform]] within [[Baliscan Confederation|Balisca]].

It has been labelled as [[W:Alter-globalization|alter-globalist]] in response to its calls for Balisca's renunciation of several international treaties and withdrawal from organization which it argues are tools for, or themselves uphold, [[W:Corporate capitalism|globalized capitalism]], including the [[Kuluba Accords]]. 

It supports upholding Balisca's [[W:free migration|free migration]] policy, while also advocating for [[Baliscan values#Immigration reform|immigration reform]] to bolster [[Baliscan Selective Service|integration programs]].

